&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working from home is here to stay, but not all of us have a spare room for a dedicated office. The good news? You can create a comfortable, productive workspace in almost any corner of your flat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s how to build a &lt;strong&gt;compact home office&lt;/strong&gt; that actually works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-pick-the-right-spot&#34;&gt;1. Pick the Right Spot&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find a corner, a wall, or even a large wardrobe gap. Your workspace doesn&amp;rsquo;t need much – just enough room for a desk, a chair, and a power socket.&lt;/p&gt;
          
          
        
